Command: Initialize
======================================================================

Description: Initialize connection to the wafer prober with two modes: Manual (direct connection) or Database (interactive selection)
Category: Setup
Execution Time: 5-15 seconds (manual) or 30-90 seconds (database)

Parameters:
  • address (string, CONDITIONAL)
    Prober network address (REQUIRED for manual mode, format: 'host:port')
  • machine_type (string, CONDITIONAL)
    Type of prober (REQUIRED for manual mode, value: 'sentio')
  • project_name (string, optional)
    Project name to open (optional, auto-opens .prj file)
  • alignment_die (string or tuple, optional)
    Alignment die position as 'col,row,subsite' (e.g., '2,2,0'). Used by AlignWafer if not specified.
  • home_die (string or tuple, optional)
    Home die position as 'col,row,subsite' (e.g., '5,2,0'). Used by FindHome if not specified.
  • force (boolean, optional)
    Force re-initialization (default: false)
  • with_db (boolean, optional)
    Use database mode for interactive initialization

Example:
  python main.py send Initialize --params='{"address":"WPMIT01.cern.ch:35555","machine_type":"sentio"}'
  python main.py send Initialize --params='{"address":"WPMIT01.cern.ch:35555","machine_type":"sentio","project_name":"NKF7_Test"}'
  python main.py send Initialize --params='{"address":"WPMIT01.cern.ch:35555","machine_type":"sentio","alignment_die":"2,2,0","home_die":"5,2,0"}'
  python main.py send Initialize with_db=true

======================================================================
